number operator a^dagger a is diagonal with entries 0..N-1: True
[a, a^dagger] = 1 except for the truncation entry: [1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, -7]
[q, p] = i (off the truncation): [I, I, I, I, I, I, I]
H = w (a^dagger a + 1/2) has eigenvalues [1/2*w, 3/2*w, 5/2*w, 7/2*w] ...
a lowers and a^dagger raises the level: a|2> = sqrt(2)|1>: True
